### **[PATTERN: ROLE-BASED-PAGES]** Adding New User Role Pages

**When creating pages for a new user role (e.g., `provider`, `vendor`), follow this structure:**

```
src/app/[role]/
├── layout.tsx                   # Role-specific layout wrapper
├── page.tsx                     # Main dashboard for this role
├── clients/                     # Client management (if applicable)
│   └── page.tsx
├── settings/                    # Role-specific settings
│   └── page.tsx
├── [feature-1]/                 # Feature-specific pages
│   ├── page.tsx
│   └── [id]/
│       └── page.tsx
└── [feature-2]/
    └── page.tsx
```

**Example: Adding Provider Role Pages**

```typescript
// src/app/provider/layout.tsx
import { DashboardLayout } from '@/components/layout/DashboardLayout';
import { CleanTopBar } from '@/components/layout/CleanTopBar';

export default function ProviderLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}) {
  return (
    <DashboardLayout>
      <CleanTopBar userRole="provider" />
      <main className="flex-1 overflow-auto">
        {children}
      </main>
    </DashboardLayout>
  );
}

// src/app/provider/page.tsx
import { createClient } from '@/lib/supabase/server';
import { redirect } from 'next/navigation';
import { ProviderDashboard } from '@/components/provider/ProviderDashboard';

export default async function ProviderPage() {
  const supabase = createClient();
  
  // Auth check
  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser();
  if (!user) redirect('/auth/signin');
  
  // Get user profile
  const { data: profile } = await supabase
    .from('user_profiles')
    .select('role, organization_id')
    .eq('user_id', user.id)
    .single();
  
  // Role check
  if (profile?.role !== 'provider') {
    redirect('/unauthorized');
  }
  
  return <ProviderDashboard />;
}
```

**Checklist for New Role Pages:**
- [ ] Create `src/app/[role]/layout.tsx` with role-specific nav
- [ ] Create `src/app/[role]/page.tsx` with auth + role checks
- [ ] Add role-specific components in `src/components/[role]/`
- [ ] Add API routes in `src/app/api/[role]/` if needed
- [ ] Update `CleanTopBar.tsx` with role-specific navigation
- [ ] Add types in `src/types/[role].ts`
- [ ] Implement data isolation (organizationId filtering) for role in database
- [ ] Add E2E tests in `tests/[role]/`

