## 📝 Documentation Requirements

### Code Comments

**When to add comments:**
```typescript
// ✅ Complex business logic
// Calculate prorated amount based on remaining days in billing cycle
// Formula: (days_remaining / total_days_in_month) * monthly_rate
const proratedAmount = (daysRemaining / totalDays) * monthlyRate;

// ✅ Non-obvious workarounds
// Workaround for Safari bug with date inputs
// See: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=123456
if (isSafari) {
  // Workaround implementation
}

// ✅ Important side effects
// This will trigger a webhook to external system
// Failure is logged but does not block the operation
await notifyExternalSystem(data);

// ❌ Obvious code (don't comment)
// Set loading to true
setLoading(true);  // No comment needed

// ❌ Outdated comments (worse than no comments)
// TODO: Fix this later (from 2023)
```

### README Files

**When to create/update README:**
- New major feature → Update main README.md
- New component library → Add component-specific README
- New API integration → Document in README-[integration].md
- New testing approach → Update testing documentation

### Migration Comments

**ALWAYS comment database migrations:**
```javascript
// Migration: Add client document management
// Author: [Your Name]
// Date: 2025-01-15
// Description: Adds collection for storing client documents with proper data isolation
// Related PRD: /tasks/0023-prd-client-documents.md

const { connectToDatabase } = require('../lib/mongodb/client');

async function up() {
  const { db } = await connectToDatabase();
  
  // Create client_documents collection with schema validation
  await db.createCollection('client_documents', {
    validator: {
      $jsonSchema: {
        bsonType: 'object',
        required: ['clientId', 'fileName', 'fileSize', 'fileType', 'storagePath', 'organizationId', 'createdAt', 'createdBy'],
        properties: {
          clientId: { bsonType: 'objectId' },
          fileName: { bsonType: 'string' },
          fileSize: { bsonType: 'int' },
          fileType: { bsonType: 'string' },
          storagePath: { bsonType: 'string' },
          organizationId: { bsonType: 'objectId' },
          createdAt: { bsonType: 'date' },
          updatedAt: { bsonType: 'date' },
          createdBy: { bsonType: 'objectId' },
          deletedAt: { bsonType: ['date', 'null'] }
        }
      }
    }
  });
  
  // Create indexes for performance and data isolation
  await db.collection('client_documents').createIndexes([
    { key: { organizationId: 1, deletedAt: 1 } },
    { key: { clientId: 1, deletedAt: 1 } },
    { key: { createdAt: -1 } }
  ]);
  
  console.log('✅ Migration completed: client_documents collection created');
}

async function down() {
  const { db } = await connectToDatabase();
  await db.collection('client_documents').drop();
  console.log('✅ Rollback completed: client_documents collection dropped');
}

module.exports = { up, down };
```

