## ⚡ Quick Reference

### Common Commands

```bash
# Development
npm run dev                  # Start dev server
npm run build               # Build for production
npm run start               # Start production server
npm run lint                # Run ESLint
npm run type-check          # Check TypeScript

# Testing
npm run test                # Run all tests
npm run test:e2e           # Run E2E tests
npx playwright test --ui    # Run tests in UI mode
npx playwright show-report  # Show test report

# Database (MongoDB)
# Migrations are handled via scripts in scripts/migrations/
node scripts/migrations/migrate-[name].js  # Run migration
node scripts/migrations/seed-[name].js     # Seed data

# Git
git status                         # Check status
git add .                          # Stage all changes
git commit -m "feat: message"      # Commit
git push                           # Push to remote
```

### **[REFERENCE: PROJECT-STRUCTURE]** File Paths

**See the comprehensive "PRODUCTION-GRADE PROJECT STRUCTURE" section above for detailed `src/` organization.**

```
📁 Root Directory Structure (keep minimal):

/next-referra/
├── src/                           # Application code (see detailed structure above)
│   ├── app/                      # Next.js App Router (pages, layouts, API routes)
│   ├── components/               # React components (organized by domain)
│   ├── lib/                      # Business logic (organized by domain)
│   ├── hooks/                    # Global React hooks
│   ├── types/                    # TypeScript definitions
│   ├── contexts/                 # React Context providers
│   └── styles/                   # Global styles
│
├── docs/                          # ALL documentation
│   ├── architecture/             # System design, data models
│   ├── planning/                 # Product plans, roadmaps
│   ├── development/              # Dev guides, workflows
│   ├── user-flows/               # User stories, personas
│   ├── testing/                  # QA guides, test plans
│   └── archived/                 # Legacy docs
│
├── scripts/                       # ALL utility scripts
│   ├── dev/                      # Development utilities
│   ├── migrations/               # Data migrations & seeding
│   ├── tools/                    # Reusable utilities
│   └── test-data/                # Test fixtures
│
├── ai-dev-tasks/                 # AI development workflow templates
│   ├── create-prd.md
│   ├── generate-tasks.md
│   └── process-task-list.md
│
├── tasks/                        # PRDs and task lists
│   ├── [n]-prd-[feature].md     # PRDs
│   └── tasks-[n]-prd-[feature].md # Task lists
│
├── tests/                        # E2E tests
│   └── [feature].spec.ts        # Playwright E2E tests
│
├── public/                       # Static assets
│   ├── fonts/                    # Font files
│   ├── images/                   # Images
│   └── icons/                    # Icons
│
├── .cursorrules                  # THIS FILE - team coding standards
├── .gitignore                    # Git ignore patterns
├── package.json                  # Dependencies
├── tsconfig.json                 # TypeScript config
├── next.config.js                # Next.js config
├── tailwind.config.ts            # Tailwind config
└── [other config files]
```

**Key Principles:**
- Keep root directory minimal (only config files and top-level folders)
- All application code in `src/` (domain-organized)
- All documentation in `docs/` (categorized)
- All scripts in `scripts/` (categorized by purpose)
- All tests in `tests/` (feature-organized)

