## 🎯 Final Reminders

1. **Security First**: Never compromise on security. When in doubt, ask.
2. **Test Everything**: Untested code is broken code.
3. **Mobile Matters**: Most users are on mobile devices.
4. **Use PRD Workflow**: For all significant features, follow the structured workflow.
5. **Ask Questions**: Better to ask than to implement wrong.
6. **Review Your Work**: Before marking complete, review your own code.
7. **Think About Users**: Every feature should improve user experience.
8. **Document Decisions**: Future you (and teammates) will thank you.
9. **Performance Matters**: Slow software is bad software.
10. **Quality Over Speed**: Do it right the first time.

---

**Remember**: You're building a production application that people rely on for their important work. Every line of code matters. Every security check matters. Every test matters. Take pride in your work and maintain these high standards.

Now go build something amazing! 🚀

